guide forever-dungeon-quests/blackrock-spire-horde
title Blackrock Spire (Horde)
category Dungeons
folder Blackrock Spire
faction Horde
levels 57-60
zone Badlands
keywords Blackrock Spire, Lower Blackrock Spire, Upper Blackrock Spire, Blackrock Mountain, Burning Steppes, Kargath, Flame Crest, Warlord Goretooth, Warlord's Command, Eitrigg, Thrall, For The Horde, Lexlort, Bijou, Galamav, Halycon, Vivian Lagrave, Darkstone Tablet, Kibler, Worg Pup, Spire Spider Eggs, Ragged John, Mother's Milk, Mother Smolderweb, Warosh, Urok Doomhowl, Tinkee Steamboil, Egg Freezing, Seal of Ascension, Vaelan, Emberstrife, Duke Hydraxis, Eye of the Emberseer, Awbee, Haleh, Pip Quickwit, Malyfous Darkhammer, Prospector Ironboot, Mosh'aru, Rend Blackhand, dungeon
why Every Horde quest of Blackrock Spire, the Lower Spire first and the Upper Spire on the second run.

# Blackrock Spire's Horde quests in one guide: Kargath, Flame Crest,
# Prospector Ironboot in Tanaris, Duke Hydraxis in Azshara, Winterspring,
# Silithus, the Eastern Plaguelands, back to Flame Crest, a first
# run in the Lower Spire, the hand-ins and the Seal of Ascension's forging in
# the Wyrmbog, a second run back through the Lower Spire into the Upper
# Spire, then the last hand-ins. Steps already done are passed over, so the
# guide picks up wherever the chain stands.
#
# The chains:
# - Warlord Goretooth's 4903 Warlord's Command -> 4941 Eitrigg's Wisdom ->
#   Thrall's 4974 For The Horde! (Rend's head, the second run); Goretooth's
#   98325 Blood and Thunder.
# - Lexlort's 4981 Operative Bijou -> Bijou's 4982 Bijou's Belongings -> 4983
#   Bijou's Reconnaissance Report; Galamav the Marksman's 4724 The Pack
#   Mistress; Vivian Lagrave's 4768 The Darkstone Tablet.
# - Kibler's 4729 Kibler's Exotic Pets and 4862 En-Ay-Es-Tee-Why; Ragged
#   John's 4866 Mother's Milk; Tinkee Steamboil's 4726 Broodling Essence ->
#   4808 -> Felnok Steelspring's 4809 Chillwind Horns -> 4810 Return to Tinkee
#   -> 4734 Egg Freezing.
# - Vaelan's 4742 -> 4743 Seal of Ascension (Polestar's Codex lists the seal
#   as removed in Forever: the quest no longer rewards it, and the Upper
#   Spire takes no key).
# - Warosh's 4867 Urok Doomhowl; Awbee's 5160 The Matron Protectorate ->
#   Haleh's 5161; Pip Quickwit's 5047 (to Malyfous Darkhammer).
# - Duke Hydraxis' 6804 Poisoned Water and 6805 Stormers and Rumblers -> 6821
#   Eye of the Emberseer.
# - For characters who handed in The God Hakkar (3528, in the Sunken Temple
#   guide), Prospector Ironboot's 5065 The Lost Tablets of Mosh'aru -> 4788
#   The Final Tablets.
#
# Left out: 6566 What the Wind Carries and on, 6569 and 6602 after For The
# Horde! (the Onyxia attunement); 5306 Snakestone of the Shadow
# Huntress and 5126 -> 5127 The Demon Forge (Blacksmithing quests); 84377 End of the Dark Horde (its enders
# stand in Stormwind); 7761 Blackhand's
# Command (the Blackwing Lair attunement); 4735 Egg Collection (it opens only
# after Egg Freezing's hand-in outside, so it would need a third run); the
# breadcrumbs 4907 (behind a Winterspring chain) and 4769 from the
# Undercity;
# 5162 and on after Haleh, 6822 The Molten Core after Hydraxis, 8181 after
# The Final Tablets; 5166 and 5167 (they need Stratholme and Scholomance);
# the Dungeon Set 2 and Valthalak quests (8931 to 9006).
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places the bosses, the NPCs or the objects
# inside, so their goals stand at the door (@34.8,85.3, Searing Gorge): the
# Lower Spire's with `group 5`, the Upper Spire's with `group 10`, as the
# client's group finder lists them (Lower 55 to 60 for five players, Upper 59
# to 60 for ten). The bosses come in the order of the client's dungeon
# journal; every quest goal is counted by the quest log, so a group that
# takes them in another order still gets each step ticked. Most of these
# quests ask for level 57, so the guide does.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items, objects and rewards: Polestar's reference data
#   (data/forever, built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's
#   Codex page for the dungeon. Each gemstone of command drops one time in
#   ten (data/forever), so those goals are optional and the seal's steps wait
#   until the quest is ready; the Forged Seal comes from an object in the
#   Wyrmbog; Vaelan's Gift, which 4743 hands over, holds the Orb of Draconic
#   Energy and the Unforged Seal; the data has no source for the Caged Worg
#   Pup. Lint warns that the door is more than 50
#   yards from the Unadorned Seal's droppers outside; the goal stays at the
#   door for the ones inside.
# - The door: QuestieDB's list of Forever's dungeons, as Polestar's Codex holds it
#   (data/codex/entrances.json).
# INGAME: where inside do Vaelan, Bijou, Warosh, Awbee, Pip Quickwit and
#   the Darkstone Tablet stand?

